Traceability Matrix
The Requirements Traceability Matrix (RTM) will be used to ensure that every system requirement is linked to one or more test cases.
Key KPI:
•	Requirements Traceability Coverage %
This ensures that important requirements such as donor registration, donation requests, blood requests, blood bag tracking, QR verification, hospital management, and user authorization are covered by testing.
